  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.0: IODream Accounts sign-in pages in the shared IODream design; safer token renewal when several iodreamvault processes run at once (keeps the company, adopts a renewal made by another process). 0.6.1: new display name. 0.6.0: the CLI tells the vault which command it runs, so plans can include or leave out run, scan and export/pull. 0.4.1: the dotnet tool now installs and runs on .NET 8, 9 and 10. 0.4.0: iv:// references in environment variables and run --env-file (filled in before the command starts; groups as JSON); export --env-file; scan --history (every commit, --since, --max-commits); scan --vault finds values stored in the vault using salted hashes only (needs a vault update). Full history: CHANGELOG.md in the package.",
  "title": "IODream Vault CLI",
  "verbatimVersion": "0.7.0",
